  C0 (net1 OUT) capacitor c=6.251537279278347p 
ends r_c_s_1 
subckt ts_c_p_1 GND IN OUT 
    C1 (IN OUT) capacitor c=1.3873982448448139p 
    G0 (OUT GND IN GND) vccs gm=0.8177977408684817m 
    R0 (OUT GND) resistor r=0.05624862689293944M 
    C0 (IN GND) capacitor c=0.6511128510099375p 
ends ts_c_p_1 
subckt single_c_1 IN OUT 
    C0 (IN OUT) capacitor c=8.485716630768874p 
